  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat",
    "Add the sliced birds-eye chillies and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it starts to brown",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the diced potatoes, smoked paprika, and vegetable broth to the skillet",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 15 minutes",
    "Stir in the crushed crackers and cook for an additional 2 minutes",
    "Serve the skillet hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired"
